{
 "_about": "The rules of the user-visible text scan, shared by robot/tools/strings_inventory.py (the report) and app/src/test/.../l10n/UserTextGuardTest.kt (the guard): both read this file, so they classify every literal the same way. Patterns are regular expressions that Python's re and Java's java.util.regex (with UNICODE_CHARACTER_CLASS) read alike. 'areas' maps a source file (its path from robot/) to the area whose baseline lists its literals: the first pattern that matches wins.",
